  "interpretation": [
    "Repeated symbol+BSOP_HOUR within a frame is a legacy collision-key group, not proof of duplicate trade. Full 58-field digest separates different records from exact identical records.",
    "Duplicate raw sequence values are not unique frame IDs; current ingestion caller also includes line number and payload SHA-256.",
    "Current normalizer includes frame-local record_index in observation ID seed; current pipeline code has already implemented the key collision mitigation.",
    "The 2026-10-01 legacy Canonical has 1,995 H0IOCNT0 rows for 2,710 Raw records (715 fewer), covers 25/26 Raw symbols, and omits C01610A41; preserve it unchanged.",
    "The 2026-10-06/07/08/12/13 legacy Canonical files are REST-only; their lack of H0IOCNT0 rows does not mean the Raw trade source is absent.",
    "The 390 repeated raw_id references in the 2026-10-01 combined Canonical are REST duplicate references, not H0IOCNT0 observation_id collisions.",
    "This is an identity/provenance audit, not an official KIS event-time certification or broker account execution validation."
  ],
